# 🚜 AgroVoice: Agricultural Advisory & Local Market Voice Assistant

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10%2B-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/)
[![Framework](https://img.shields.io/badge/Gradio-Web%20UI-orange.svg)](https://gradio.app/)
[![Model](https://img.shields.io/badge/STT-Faster--Whisper-green.svg)](https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-brightgreen.svg)](LICENSE)

An end-to-end voice-driven assistant built to process agricultural queries, crop advisory commands, and market price checks spoken in localized **Nigerian Pidgin** and **English**.

---

## 🌟 Key Features

* **🎙️ Faster-Whisper Speech Recognition:** Localized GPU-accelerated transcription handling regional speech patterns.
* **🧠 NLP Intent Engine:** Scikit-Learn pipeline (`TF-IDF Vectorizer` + `LogisticRegression`) trained across 5 agricultural intents.
* **🔍 Entity & Slot Parsing:** Custom regex extractor identifying crop names, input supplies, locations/markets, and quantities.
* **🛡️ Low-Confidence Safety Fallback:** Automatically intercepts low-confidence predictions (<55%) to prevent misrouting farm advisory.
* **🔊 Voice Audio Loop:** Speech synthesis via Google Text-to-Speech (`gTTS`) providing interactive spoken feedback.
* **💻 Interactive Web UI:** Built with Gradio featuring multi-input audio recording and sample test prompts.

---

## 🎯 Intent Schema & Sample Test Matrix

| Intent Class | Sample Speech Input | Parsed Slot Entities | System Response Action |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `CHECK_MARKET_PRICE` | *"How much be bag of garri for Mile 12 market?"* | `crop`: Garri, `location`: Mile 12 | Fetches live produce market rates |
| `PEST_ADVISORY` | *"Insects dey chop my maize leaves wetin I go spray?"* | `crop`: Maize | Generates crop pest treatment guidance |
| `ORDER_INPUTS` | *"I wan buy two bags of NPK fertilizer for my farm"* | `crop/input`: NPK, `qty`: Two Bags | Routes order to agricultural supplier |
| `WEATHER_FORECAST` | *"Rain go fall for Ibadan tomorrow morning?"* | `location`: Ibadan | Fetches regional farming weather outlook |
| `CUSTOMER_SUPPORT`| *"Abeg connect me to extension officer"* | `None` | Connects call to agricultural agent |

---

## 🏗️ End-to-End Pipeline Architecture

```text
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   User Audio Recording  │ (Browser Microphone / Upload)
└────────────┬────────────┘
             │
             ▼
┌─────────────────────────┐
│  Faster-Whisper Engine  │ (Speech-to-Text Transcription)
└────────────┬────────────┘
             │
             ▼
┌─────────────────────────┐
│ TF-IDF + ML Classifier  │ ──► Confidence < 55%? ──► [ Triggers Safety Fallback ]
└────────────┬────────────┘
             │
             ▼ (Confidence >= 55%)
┌─────────────────────────┐
│ Entity & Slot Parser    │ (Extracts Crop, Market Location, and Quantity)
└────────────┬────────────┘
             │
             ▼
┌─────────────────────────┐
│ gTTS Speech Synthesis   │ ──► Output: Spoken Response (.mp3) + Gradio Audio Player
└─────────────────────────┘
